{"id":"39.3.7.5","doc":"T","title":"Configuration Example for Multi-Channel Scanning","words":224,"blocks":[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":1,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"In this example, the following channels are selected for multi-channel scanning for "},{"t":"block","v":"SAR ADC1","id":"adc"},{"t":"text","v":":"}]}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":2,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Channel 2, with the attenuation of "},{"t":"num","v":"12 dB","k":"other"},{"t":"text","v":"."}]},{"n":3,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"See Figure 39.3-9."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":4,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Channel 0, with the attenuation of "},{"t":"num","v":"2.5 dB","k":"other"},{"t":"text","v":"."}]},{"n":5,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"See Figure 39.3-10."}]}]}]]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":6,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The detailed configuration is as follows:"}]}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":7,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Configure SAR ADC1:"}]}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":8,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Configure the first pattern table entry (cmd0, "},{"t":"reg","v":"APB_SARADC_SAR1_PATT_TAB1_REG"},{"t":"text","v":"[5:0]), Figure 39.3-9 (SAR ADC1 cmd0 Configuration):"}]}]},{"t":"table","head":[[{"t":"text","v":"Field"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Bits"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Value"}]],"rows":[{"n":9,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"ch_sel"}],[{"t":"text","v":"[5:2]"}],[{"t":"text","v":"2"}]]},{"n":10,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"atten"}],[{"t":"text","v":"[1:0]"}],[{"t":"text","v":"3"}]]}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":11,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"atten: write the value of 3 to this field, to set the attenuation to "},{"t":"num","v":"12 dB","k":"other"},{"t":"text","v":"."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":12,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"ch_sel: write the value of 2 to this field, to select channel 2 (see "},{"t":"xref","id":"39.3.4","c":[{"t":"text","v":"Table 39.3-1"}]},{"t":"text","v":")."}]}]}]]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":13,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Configure the second pattern table entry (cmd1, "},{"t":"reg","v":"APB_SARADC_SAR1_PATT_TAB1_REG"},{"t":"text","v":"[11:6]), Figure 39.3-10 (SAR ADC1 cmd1 Configuration):"}]}]},{"t":"table","head":[[{"t":"text","v":"Field"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Bits"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Value"}]],"rows":[{"n":14,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"ch_sel"}],[{"t":"text","v":"[5:2]"}],[{"t":"text","v":"0"}]]},{"n":15,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"atten"}],[{"t":"text","v":"[1:0]"}],[{"t":"text","v":"1"}]]}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":16,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"atten: write the value of 1 to this field, to set the attenuation to "},{"t":"num","v":"2.5 dB","k":"other"},{"t":"text","v":"."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":17,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"ch_sel: write the value of 0 to this field, to select channel 0 (see "},{"t":"xref","id":"39.3.4","c":[{"t":"text","v":"Table 39.3-1"}]},{"t":"text","v":")."}]}]}]]}]]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":18,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Configure "},{"t":"field","v":"APB_SARADC_SAR1_PATT_LEN"},{"t":"text","v":" to 1, i.e., set pattern table length to (this value + 1 = 2)."}]},{"n":19,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Then pattern table entries cmd0 and cmd1 for SAR ADC1 will be used."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":20,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Enable the timer, then DIG ADC1 controller start scanning the channel 2 and channel 0 of SAR ADC1 in cycles, as configured in the pattern table entries."}]}]}]]}]}